@page "/Account/ForgotPasswordConfirmation"
@layout AuthLayout

<PageTitle>Forgot password confirmation - Wyrm</PageTitle>
<h2 class="glass-text mb-0 text-center pb-3">Forgot password confirmation</h2>

<p class="glass-text">
    If an account exists with that email address, a password reset link will have been emailed to it.
</p>

<p class="glass-text">
    That email is time sensitive if you do not use it promptly it will expire and you will need to revisit
    the forgot password page to generate another link.
</p>

<a href="Account/Login">Back to the logon page</a>
